-- Azeroth Naturalist (module #4, science): content. Original writing, checked for scientific
-- accuracy at each age band. Real-world science, with Azeroth places and creatures as the
-- setting. Where a fact is about our real world (Earth's one moon, the speed of sound...) the
-- question says so; Azeroth's own lore is only used as scenery.
--
-- Curated entries: { lv = 1..3, q = question, a = answer, d = { distractors, best first },
--   why = short explanation shown after a miss,
--   t = { accepted typed spellings } (optional: the answer may be TYPED on Rune/Glyph tiers;
--       entries without t are always multiple choice) }
-- Initiate entries need 2+ distractors (3 buttons), Adept/Magister entries need 3 (4 buttons).
local _, ns = ...

local D = {}
ns.NaturalistData = D

